# s54 — native role routing: a kanji 位置 column declared the pos role receives spawn
# `at` positions, and a kanji 鍵 column declared the keys role mints ids — the routing
# an English world gets for free from the literal names pos/keys, a native world gets by
# `role`. 資金 carries default 25 so the minted row witnesses the default under a mangled name.
n 2
col 生成器 bool 0 1
col 手先 bool 0 0
col 位置 vec 5 5 | 6 6
col 資金 num 100 200
default 資金 25
col 鍵 num 10 20
col 親 num -1 -1
role pos 位置
role keys 鍵
role parent 親
bind 出現 point 7 8
